III. UNION TYPE 
1.   Declaration 
Similar to structures, a union also has multiple members, but its members
share the same memory location. Therefore, the size of a union is
the size of its largest member, and modifying one member will affect all
the other members. 
union <type_name> { 
Danh sách các thành ph ầ n; 
}; 
