Since no constructor is explicitly defined in   Apple ,   Apple ’s default no-arg construc-
tor is defined implicitly. Since   Apple   is a derived class of   Fruit ,   Apple ’s default 
constructor automatically invokes   Fruit ’s no-arg constructor. However,   Fruit   does
not have a no-arg constructor, because   Fruit   has an explicit constructor defined.
Therefore, the program cannot be compiled. 
